   1093  f6aa							; Line 2: Lives (P0, green squares) + KEY indicator (P1, yellow, right)
   1094  f6aa							; P0 NUSIZ by lives: $03=3 copies, $01=2, $00=1; GRP0 lit only if lives>0
   1095  f6aa							; P1 = the KEY square, lit while KeyHeld (LevelStartRoom b7), X 132.
   1096  f6aa							; Same 8-line structure for every lives count: 2 SetObjectXPos (P0, P1)
