   1345  f828							; ====================================================================
   1346  f828							; Pad remaining scanlines to reach exactly 48 total
   1347  f828							; Path A (PlayerLives > 0) — execution count:
   1348  f828							;   Top gap:  6 (4 + 2 former ball-pos lines — elements keep lines)
   1349  f828							;   Timer:    3 loop + 1 gap = 4
   1350  f828							;   Lives:    2 SetObjectXPos (P0 lives, P1 key) + 1 HMOVE + 5 render
   1351  f828							;	       + 1 gap = 9
   1352  f828							;   Bombs:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 5 render + 3 gap = 11
   1353  f828							;   Score:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 7 ScoreLoop = 10
   1354  f828							;   Subtotal: 6+4+9+11+10 = 40
   1355  f828							;   Pad:      48 - 40 = 8
   1356  f828							; Both lives paths run the same instructions (GRP0/GRP1 just stay 0),
   1357  f828							; so the band is 48 lines for every lives count and every key state.
   1358  f828							; ====================================================================
