   1668  fa26							; GetConnIdx RETIRED (C3, 2026-10-20): the four exit handlers moved to
   1669  fa26							; bank2 and read the connection record in-bank (LevelConnB2), so this pad's
   1670  fa26							; body had no caller. Deleting it (plus the bank0 `sta` half and this bank's
   1671  fa26							; `jmp` half) reclaimed 15 B here and removed a live-but-uncalled pad.
   1672  fa26
   1673  fa26							; ClearPFColumn — A = left-half col 0..19; LineCount ($84) = first row;
   1674  fa26							;   CollisionEndY = last row (inclusive). AND-clear that col's
   1675  fa26							;   PF bit in those rows only. Clobbers A/X/Y + CPCScratch ($89) — NO
   1676  fa26							;   CollisionX (plan 5.1: BombMarkWalls keeps its broken-wall count there
   1677  fa26							;   across the call). Same-bank rts tail: BombMarkWalls jsrs this directly;
   1678  fa26							;   the old CallPad_ClearPFColumn path died with ApplyBombWalls (dead pad
   1679  fa26							;   kept).
   1680  fa26							;   Scratched retargeted Temp ($AD = bank0 TickCounter!) → $89 (plan 5.1b,
