   1722  fa6b							; AddScore — add BCD amount in A (e.g. #$50, #$75) to HUD score.
   1723  fa6b							; ScoreTh/ScoreHu = binary 0-9; ScoreTe = packed BCD. Clobbers A.
   1724  fa6b							; Real 6502 BCD add — SED/ADC/CLD straight-line: D is cleared before any
   1725  fa6b							; jsr, the 2600 has no interrupts, and nothing here restores D via plp
   1726  fa6b							; (the 2026-09-23 decimal-mode rule). The old BINARY `cmp #$A0 / sbc #$A0`
   1727  fa6b							; fix-up missed nibble-level overflow: $25+$75 = $9A stored raw -> ones
   1728  fa6b							; digit A -> glyph index 10 -> DigitGfx+80 (past the 10-glyph font) =
   1729  fa6b							; the solid-block score digit (screenshots/score_issue_002.png).
   1730  fa6b							; C=1 = BCD carry (sum >= 100) -> ScoreHu path.
   1731  fa6b							; SIZE PIN: routine runs $FA7D..$FAA4 exactly (UpdateLaserSound's pad
   1732  fa6b							; target is $FAA5). Old head = clc/adc/cmp/bcc/sbc = 9 bytes, new head =
   1733  fa6b							; sed/clc/adc/cld/bcc = 7, so the two nops restore the exact length —
   1734  fa6b							; without them every pad below shifts silently.
