   2404  fe03							; --- does the player count as "over the raft"? --------------------------
   2405  fe03							; The raft is a FERRY (user rule 2026-10-18): it moves ONLY while he is over
   2406  fe03							; it, parks the moment he steps off, and its position resets on room entry
   2407  fe03							; (LoadEnemyRam re-copies the record's spawn x). Gating the whole motion
   2408  fe03							; block here is what makes it park; the pin/carry later still applies while
   2409  fe03							; riding. The test runs against the CURRENT x (before the step), i.e. the
   2410  fe03							; raft he is actually standing on.
